    GC_Briefing "{D27305214613205E}" {
     m_iOrder 18
     m_sTitle "VIII. NSV Weapon Team (READ)"
     m_sContent "The NSV HMG supplied to the Russian team is the scoped varitant. Both parts of the weapon (gun & tripod) are located on their dedicated units. Unless both of these roles are slotted the NSV will not be available, this is by design. If the choice is made to not slot them do not ask for a replacment NSV."\
     ""\
     "The UAZ452 van is the dedicated vehicle of the NSV team, it has been loaded with their entire supply of NSV ammuniton."\
